<title>USA: Sterling Chemicals issues $150 mln debt.</title>
<headline>Sterling Chemicals issues $150 mln debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Sterling Chemicals Inc was priced in the 144A private placement market on Tuesday, according to a high-yield syndicate source.</p>
<p>Sterling Chemicals is a petrochemical producer.</p>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston was lead manager on the deal.</p>
<p>BORROWER STERLING CHEMICAL INC</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 11.25 PCT  MATURITY 4/01/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SUB NOTES ISS PRICE 98.533  FIRST PAY DATE 10/01/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B3    YIELD 11.50 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-PLUS    SPREAD 462 BP     CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>Note: three year equity call for 35 percent at par plus coupon</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1672))</p>
</text>
